<p style=3D"font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-a=
lign: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">WHEREAS, COF II owns
certain real property consisting of an outparcel adjacent to the Shopping C=
enter.</p>

<p style=3D"font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-a=
lign: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">&nbsp;</p>

<p style=3D"font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-a=
lign: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">WHEREAS, Seller desires
to sell to Buyer, and Buyer desires to purchase from Seller, the Property (=
as hereinafter defined), on the terms and conditions
contained in this Agreement;</p>

