bsp;&nbsp;</b></font><b><u>Due
Diligence Period</u></b>. Buyer shall have until 5:00 pm Eastern time on th=
e day which is forty-five (45) days after the Effective
Date (the =93<b><u>Due Diligence Period</u></b>=94) to conduct such due dil=
igence review of the Property, all of the items
to be furnished by Seller to Buyer pursuant to Section&nbsp;3.3 below and a=
ll records and other materials related thereto as Buyer
deems appropriate in its sole and absolute discretion. Notwithstanding the =
foregoing, Buyer shall have the option to extend the
Due Diligence Period for one (1) additional period of ten (10) days (the =
=93<b><u>Extension Option</u></b>=94) by providing
written notice to Seller of Buyer=92s exercise of its Extension Option on o=
r before the date on which the Due Diligence Period
was to expire.</p>

