bsp;&nbsp;</b></font><b><u>Items
to be Provided by Seller</u></b><u>.</u> To the extent not previously deliv=
ered to Buyer, Seller shall deliver to Buyer all of
the items specified on <b><u>Exhibit E</u></b> attached hereto (collectivel=
y, the =93<b><u>Property Information</u></b>=94)
within three (3) Business Days after the Effective Date to the extent such =
items are in Seller=92s (or its affiliates=92
or Property Manager=92s) possession or control. Except as otherwise express=
ly set forth in Section 4.1, Seller makes no representations
or warranties of any kind with regard thereto. Buyer agrees not to disclose=
 such non-public Property Information, or any of the
provisions, terms or conditions thereof, to any party outside of Buyer=92s =
organization other than its legal counsel, lenders,
investors, surveyor, title company, broker, accountants, consultants, offic=
ers, partners, directors, members and shareholders.
Buyer=92s obligations under this Section 3.3 shall survive any termination =
of this Agreement.</p>

