man, Times, Serif"><b>6.2&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&n=
bsp;&nbsp;</b></font><b><u>Seller=92s
Default</u></b><u>. </u> If the sale contemplated hereby is not consummated=
 because of a material default of Seller, then, so long
as Buyer has performed or tendered performance of all of Buyer=92s material=
 obligations in accordance with this Agreement,
and upon written notice from Buyer to Seller, Buyer shall have the right to=
 exercise any of the following remedies:</p>

<p style=3D"font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-a=
lign: justify; text-indent: 1in"><b>&nbsp;</b></p>

<p style=3D"font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-a=
lign: justify; text-indent: 1in"><font style=3D"font-family: Times New Roma=
n, Times, Serif"><b>6.2.1&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</b></fo=
nt>Waive
such failure and proceed to the Closing with no reduction in the Purchase P=
rice; provided, however, that this provision will not
limit Buyer=92s right to receive reimbursement for reasonable attorney=92s =
fees pursuant to Section&nbsp;9.9 below in connection
with any legal proceedings instituted by either party or Escrow Holder with=
 respect to the enforcement of this Agreement, nor waive
or affect Seller=92s indemnity obligations under this Agreement or Buyer=92=
s rights to enforce those indemnity obligations,
nor waive or affect any of Seller=92s other obligations under this Agreemen=
t to be performed after the Closing or Buyer=92s
rights to enforce those obligations.</p>

