n, Times, Serif"><b>6.2.2&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</b></fo=
nt>Treat
this Agreement as being in full force and effect and pursue an action for s=
pecific performance to cause Seller to convey the Property
to Buyer pursuant to the terms and conditions of this Agreement; provided, =
however, Buyer must commence any such actions for specific
performance within sixty (60) days of the Closing Date.</p>

