n, Times, Serif"><b>6.2.3&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</b></fo=
nt>Terminate
this Agreement by notice to Seller to that effect, in which event the parti=
es hereto shall have no further obligations hereunder
except those which expressly survive termination hereof, and Buyer shall be=
 entitled to (i) recover the full amount of the Deposit,
and (ii) recover up to $20,000.00 for actual third-party out-of-pocket expe=
nses incurred in connection with Buyer=92s inspection
and due diligence investigation of the Property.</p>

