<p style=3D"font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-a=
lign: justify; text-indent: 1in"><font style=3D"font-family: Times New Roma=
n, Times, Serif"><b>6.2.4&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</b></fo=
nt>Except
as expressly set forth in this Agreement, Buyer waives any right to pursue =
any other remedy at law or equity for such default of
Seller, including, without limitation, any right to seek, claim or obtain d=
amages, punitive damages or consequential damages.</p>

<p style=3D"font: bold 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; t=
ext-align: center; text-indent: 0in">&nbsp;</p>

<p style=3D"font: bold 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; t=
ext-align: center; text-indent: 0in">ARTICLE 7</p>

<p style=3D"font: bold 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; t=
ext-align: center; text-indent: 0in">CASUALTY DAMAGE OR
CONDEMNATION</p>

<p style=3D"font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-a=
lign: justify; text-indent: 0.5in"><b>&nbsp;</b></p>

<p style=3D"font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-a=
lign: justify; text-indent: 0.5in"><font style=3D"font-family: Times New Ro=
man, Times, Serif"><b>7.1&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&n=
bsp;&nbsp;</b></font><b><u>Casualty</u></b><u>.</u>
If the Improvements are damaged by casualty prior to the Closing and the co=
st for repair is reasonably estimated by Seller to exceed
the sum of $300,000.00, Buyer shall have the option, in Buyer=92s sole and =
absolute discretion, to elect either to:</p>

<p style=3D"font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-a=
lign: justify; text-indent: 1.5in"><b>&nbsp;</b></p>

<p style=3D"font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-a=
lign: justify; text-indent: 1.5in"><font style=3D"font-family: Times New Ro=
man, Times, Serif"><b>(a)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&n=
bsp;&nbsp;</b></font>acquire
the Property as is (without reduction in the Purchase Price), plus an assig=
nment from Seller without recourse or credit of any
insurance proceeds payable by virtue of such loss or damage, plus a credit =
for any deductible under said policy and a credit for
any uninsured loss; or</p>

<p style=3D"font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-a=
lign: justify; text-indent: 1.5in"><b>&nbsp;</b></p>

<p style=3D"font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-a=
lign: justify; text-indent: 1.5in"><font style=3D"font-family: Times New Ro=
man, Times, Serif"><b>(b)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&n=
bsp;&nbsp;</b></font>terminate
this Agreement and receive back the Deposit.</p>

<p style=3D"font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 2.8=
5pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 69.15pt">&nbsp;</p>

<p style=3D"font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 2.8=
5pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 69.15pt">Such right
must be exercised within thirty (30) days from the earlier of the date Sell=
er provides Buyer with notice of the loss of the event
giving rise to such right. If Buyer fails to provide notice of an election,=
 then Buyer shall have been deemed to elect (b)&nbsp;above.</p>

<p style=3D"font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 2.8=
5pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 69.15pt">&nbsp;</p>

<p style=3D"font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 2.8=
5pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 69.15pt">If the
Improvements are damaged by casualty prior to Closing and the cost for repa=
ir is reasonably estimated by Seller (as set forth in
this Section 7.1) not to exceed the sum of $300,000.00, then Buyer shall ac=
quire the Property in accordance with Section 7.1(a)
of this Agreement.</p>

<p style=3D"font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-a=
lign: justify; text-indent: 0.5in"><b>&nbsp;</b></p>

<p style=3D"font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-a=
lign: justify; text-indent: 0.5in"><font style=3D"font-family: Times New Ro=
man, Times, Serif"><b>7.2&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&n=
bsp;&nbsp;</b></font><b><u>Condemnation</u></b><u>.</u>
In the event that a condemnation proceeding shall be initiated against any =
material portion of the Real Property prior to the Closing,
Buyer shall have the option, in Buyer=92s sole and absolute discretion, to =
elect either to:</p>

<p style=3D"font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-a=
lign: justify; text-indent: 1.5in"><b>&nbsp;</b></p>

<p style=3D"font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-a=
lign: justify; text-indent: 1.5in"><font style=3D"font-family: Times New Ro=
man, Times, Serif"><b>(a)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&n=
bsp;&nbsp;</b></font>terminate
this Agreement and receive back the Deposit; or</p>

<p style=3D"font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-a=
lign: justify; text-indent: 1.5in"><b>&nbsp;</b></p>

<p style=3D"font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-a=
lign: justify; text-indent: 1.5in"><font style=3D"font-family: Times New Ro=
man, Times, Serif"><b>(b)&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&n=
bsp;&nbsp;</b></font>close
the transaction contemplated by this Agreement.</p>

<p style=3D"font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-a=
lign: justify; text-indent: 71.25pt">&nbsp;</p>

<p style=3D"font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-a=
lign: justify; text-indent: 71.25pt">In all other cases,
or if Buyer elects to proceed under Section&nbsp;7.2(b), Buyer shall purcha=
se the Property in accordance with the terms hereof
(without reduction in the Purchase Price) and Seller shall assign to Buyer =
at Closing all condemnation proceeds payable as a result
of such condemnation. Buyer shall be deemed to have elected to proceed unde=
r Section&nbsp;7.2(b)&nbsp;unless, within thirty (30)
days from the earlier of written notice of the condemnation, Buyer provides=
 Seller with written notice that Buyer elects to terminate
this Agreement pursuant to Section&nbsp;7.2(a).</p>

<p style=3D"font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;=
</p>


